* MINT-ERRORS: 10 10 10 10
* Ref: ../dbase3-decomp/specs/commands/set-commands.md:153
* Real III+ 1.1 probes: FIXED ON keeps the integer room of a value's picture and
* replaces its decimals with SET DECIMALS (rounded at display; the stored value
* is untouched); STORE under ON stores the transformed picture.
? "[W2-BEGIN]"
? "[DEFAULT FIXED OFF DECIMALS TWO]"
? 7, 1.2+2.3, 22/7
SET DECIMALS TO 4
SET FIXED ON
? "[FIXED ON DECIMALS FOUR]"
? 7, 1.2+2.3, 22/7
SET FIXED OFF
? "[FIXED OFF DECIMALS FOUR]"
? 7, 1.2+2.3, 22/7
? "[BAD TOGGLE]"
SET FIXED MAYBE
? "[LITERALS AND EXPRESSIONS DECIMALS TWO]"
SET DECIMALS TO 2
SET FIXED ON
? 7, 7.5555, 1.23456, 0.5, -3, -3.456
? 2*3.5, 10/4, 10-2.5, 100000+0.5
? 123456789012
STORE 5 TO N
STORE 3.14159 TO M
? N, M, N+M
? VAL("3.5"), INT(3.7), LEN("ab"), RECNO()
? MOD(7,3), SQRT(16)
? "[FIELDS DECIMALS FOUR]"
USE BASE
GO TOP
SET DECIMALS TO 4
? BAL, BAL+1, -BAL, BAL*2
LIST NAME, BAL, BAL+1, 5, 2.5
GO TOP
DISPLAY BAL, BAL/3, BAL*2
GO TOP
STORE BAL TO B
STORE BAL+1 TO B1
SET FIXED OFF
? B, B1
SET FIXED ON
? B, B1
? "[DECIMALS ZERO ONE EIGHT]"
SET DECIMALS TO 0
? 7, 7.5, 22/7
GO 2
? BAL, BAL+1
LIST NEXT 1 BAL, BAL+1
SET DECIMALS TO 1
? 3, -3.5, 0.04, B
? STR(BAL), STR(1.5,6), LEN(STR(BAL))
SET DECIMALS TO 8
? 7, 7.5, 22/7, 1.2+2.3
SET DECIMALS TO 2
SET FIXED OFF
? "[AFTER OFF]"
? 7, 7.5555, 1.23456, 2*3.5, 22/7, 123456789012
? "[FORMS]"
SET FIXED TO ON
SET FIXED
SET FIXED OF
? 7
SET FIXE ON
? 7, 22/7
SET FIXED OFF junk
? 7
SET FIXED ON  junk
? 7
SET FIXED OFF
? 7
? "[W2-END]"
RETURN
